@       IN      NSEC    mail.dnssec-test.example. A NS SOA MX AAAA RRSIG NSEC DNSKEY TXT
@       IN      RRSIG   NSEC 8 2 3600 (
                        20250201000000 20250101000000 12345 dnssec-test.example.
