; DS Record - Delegation Signer (for chain of trust to parent zone)
; Format: DS <key-tag> <algorithm> <digest-type> <digest>
; Digest Type: 2 = SHA-256

; DS record for KSK (tag 54321) - This would be published in parent zone
; This demonstrates the chain of trust from parent to child zone
